 "captions": {
  "h02": [
   "One meeting. One silent phone.",
   "And your parcel rides away."
  ],
  "h03": [
   "Across Vietnam, 8–12% of orders",
   "are refused at the door."
  ],
  "h04": [
   "And buyers can’t choose a delivery time.",
   "Not on Shopee.",
   "So everything rides on one phone call."
  ],
  "h05": [
   "Buyers want a say.",
   "Shippers just want someone to pick up."
  ],
  "h06": [
   "Every failed order costs the seller up to ₫40,000.",
   "For one area, we estimate ₫473 million a month."
  ],
  "h07": [
   "So let’s follow just one of those calls."
  ],
  "n01": [
   "It’s 10:02.",
   "Quan is in a meeting.",
   "And the phone? On silent."
  ],
  "n02": [
   "At the door, Tuong is waiting, air fryer in hand.",
   "One call. Two calls… Nothing."
  ],
  "n03": [
   "Thirty more orders are waiting.",
   "So the parcel goes back on the bike.",
   "And all that’s left is two sad little words.",
   "No answer."
  ],
  "n04": [
   "We’ve all been Quan.",
   "And we’ve all felt a little bad for Tuong."
  ],
  "n05": [
   "So we built Alodi.",
   "An agentic recovery system for failed deliveries,",
   "so the second try actually lands."
  ],
  "p01": [
   "Here’s how it works.",
   "At 6:00 in the morning, Alodi asks Quan when to come.",
   "Three windows, or not today. Just a tap or two."
  ],
  "p02": [
   "But Quan’s still asleep.",
   "No reply by eight, so the route locks as planned."
  ],
  "n06": [
   "Then at 10:02, the same missed call.",
   "But now, Tuong taps one button.",
   "No typing. No calling back.",
   "And off to the next stop."
  ],
  "n07": [
   "From here, Alodi takes over.",
   "First, a friendly message to Quan, right away."
  ],
  "n08": [
   "An hour later? Still quiet.",
   "So Alodi does something lovely.",
   "It picks up the phone."
  ],
  "a01": [
   "Hi Quan! This is Alodi, your delivery assistant.",
   "This call is recorded. When’s a good time?"
  ],
  "m01": [
   "Oh, sorry! Tomorrow after five, please.",
   "Leave it with security in Tower B.",
   "Or call my wife."
  ],
  "n09": [
   "Did you catch all that? Alodi did.",
   "When. Where. Who.",
   "All in one neat little card."
  ],
  "n10": [
   "It checks the rules,",
   "then sends the card straight to Loi, the next shipper."
  ],
  "n11": [
   "And the next evening?",
   "No calls. No guessing.",
   "Just… delivered."
  ],
  "n12": [
   "Quan gets the parcel.",
   "Loi saves a trip.",
   "The seller keeps the sale."
  ],
  "n13": [
   "Already agreed a new time at the door?",
   "Tuong holds the button and says it, in ten seconds.",
   "Alodi writes the same card."
  ],
  "n14": [
   "And when an answer isn’t clear, or a buyer says no?",
   "Alodi stops, and hands it to Yoshio, in customer support.",
   "Because some calls should stay human."
  ],
  "n15": [
   "Meanwhile, the hub sees every rescue,",
   "live, on one dashboard."
  ],
  "o01": [
   "So what’s it worth?",
   "For one area, we estimate up to ₫187 million saved, every month."
  ],
  "o03": [
   "And it runs on OpenAI.",
   "GPT-Live-1 makes the call.",
   "GPT Transcribe hears the memo.",
   "GPT-6.1 Terra writes the card."
  ],
  "o04": [
   "And we built it all with Codex."
  ]
 }
}